1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,994
Carbon dioxide travels three ways.

2
00:00:02,994 --> 00:00:10,286
About seventy percent as bicarbonate, made inside red cells by the enzyme carbonic anhydrase.

3
00:00:10,286 --> 00:00:14,557
About a quarter bound to haemoglobin as carbaminohaemoglobin.

4
00:00:14,557 --> 00:00:17,304
And about seven percent simply dissolved.

